      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"http://sentinelsdigital.com/anniversary4\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://sentinelsdigital.com/anniversary4</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>NOOOOOOO!!!&nbsp;<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/fc0ea567c2c5e1d833cb722c49c1d00e0f5f966e.gif\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"zXNHvmQQSiM5NXOTlcZLpQHsXD0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"animated\"></p>\n<p>I’ll be volunteering at the Heartland Film Festival that entire time!&nbsp;<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/639576a9466a522294bf51ad99520eef2652a92c.gif\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"ecXuBKbaioeOXK79U3GURnDEbPm\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Guess I’m going to have to revisit my schedule for the Fest…&nbsp;<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/8d508791a1a00b13c2bb99ff63920ad3e3583301.gif\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"ka7R8OGETnk0jL0K8DcghjoOdoJ\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>(Thanks for sharing, Powerhound_2000!)</p>",
